b16678234.desc:
CRC Property is proud to present a fully fitted office in the prestigious Marina Plaza Tower, boasting stunning Sheikh Zayed Road views. 

KEY PROPERTY DETAILS:
- Size of 3,705 sqft, vacant now;
- Functional office with multiple glass partitions and meeting rooms;
- Full-height, full-width glazing for ample natural light;
- Built in pantry;
- 8 allocated car parking spaces;
- Service Charges are included in the rent;
- Chiller is included in the rent, DEWA on the tenant;
- Mainland license is required;
- Easy access to Sheikh Zayed Road, connected to Marina Tram and Metro

Marina Plaza in Dubai is a prominent commercial and residential development located in the heart of Dubai Marina. The building is strategically located in Dubai Marina, providing easy access to major roads and public transportation, making it a convenient spot for both employees and clients. 
Marina Plaza is connected to Marina Mall, which features a variety of restaurants, cafes, retail shops, and leisure activities, all contributing to an enhanced work environment. 

Please reach out to CRC Property to obtain comprehensive information and arrange a viewing.

